# Event photographs (public/events/). Most show children, and this repository
# is PUBLIC, so committing a file publishes it. A photograph that depicts a
# minor stays out of git until guardian consent is recorded for it in
# src/content/seed/event-photos.ts. Ignore the CONTENTS (`/*`), not the
# directory: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is ignored.
# Once consent is recorded, un-ignore that one file with a `!` line below.
# The photographs that show adults only are un-ignored here.
public/events/*
!public/events/img_16.jpg
!public/events/img_17.jpg
!public/events/img_8352.jpg
